  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "Fun House is based on a children's television game show of the same name.\n\nThe basic premise of the game is to get through the 72 rooms of the Fun House. The object of each room is to throw tomatoes at the targets littered throughout the room before time expires. Sometimes these targets are numbered, so they have to be hit in numerical order. After all targets are hit, a key will appear allowing the player to move on to the next room. \n\nThis may appear simple, but the player's character is on rollerblades, thus making navigating not such a simple task. There are also blobs, boingers, the banana launcher, and the spray gun which will either try to hinder progress or take away time if the player gets hit by them. The player also has to deal with various terrain obstacles in each room such as slime covered ramps or icy floors.\n\nThe player starts with three lives, but can earn more by collecting 25 silver coins. There are also gold coins with each one equaling 5 silver coins.\n\nOther helpful items the player can collect are glop clocks, with the small ones adding 8 seconds, and the large ones adding 15 seconds to the game clock. There are also sneakers which will temporarily increase the player's speed. There are also starbursts, which increase the players score and warp cubes, which will send the player to another part of the Fun House."
    },
    {
      "langue": "fr",
      "text": "Fun House sur Nes est un jeu inspiré du TV Show américain du même nom. Dans une ambiance de fête, vous devez éviter les nombreux pièges qui vous attendent."
    },
    {
      "langue": "de",
      "text": "Fun House basiert auf der gleichnamigen Kinderfernsehserie. Das Grundprinzip des Spiels besteht darin, durch die 72 Räume des Fun House zu kommen. In jedem Raum geht es darum, vor Ablauf der Zeit Tomaten auf die im Raum verstreuten Ziele zu werfen. Manchmal sind diese Ziele nummeriert, so dass sie in numerischer Reihenfolge getroffen werden müssen. Nachdem alle Ziele getroffen wurden, erscheint ein Schlüssel, mit dem der Spieler in den nächsten Raum gehen kann."
    },
    {
      "langue": "es",
      "text": "Fun House se basa en el programa de televisión para niños del mismo nombre. La premisa básica del juego es conseguir a través de las 72 habitaciones de la casa de la diversión. El objeto de cada habitación es tirar tomates a los blancos esparcidos por toda la habitación antes de que expire el tiempo. A veces, estos objetivos están numerados, así que tienen que ser golpeado en orden numérico. Después de que todos los objetivos se alcanzaron, aparecerá una llave que permite al jugador pasar a la habitación de al lado."
    },
    {
      "langue": "it",
      "text": "Fun House è basato sull'omonimo programma televisivo per bambini. La premessa di base del gioco è attraversare le 72 stanze della casa dei divertimenti. L'obiettivo di ogni stanza è lanciare pomodori contro i bersagli sparsi per la stanza prima che scada il tempo. A volte questi obiettivi sono numerati, quindi devono essere colpiti in ordine numerico. Dopo che tutti gli obiettivi sono stati raggiunti, apparirà una chiave che consente al giocatore di spostarsi nella stanza successiva."
    },
    {
      "langue": "pt",
      "text": "Fun House é um jogo inspirado no programa de TV americano de mesmo nome. Em uma atmosfera de festa, você deve evitar as muitas armadilhas que o esperam."
    }
  ],
